# The project's existing style: LLVM defaults, which the HIP source already
# matches exactly. Kept deliberately close to upstream LLVM so that the code
# quoted in the accompanying blog posts stays identical to the code here.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 120
PointerAlignment: Right
SortIncludes: false
...
